        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "还…呢 can reject an unrealistic expectation rhetorically. Read the surrounding complaint; this is not a neutral statement of continuation.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "还喝茶呢，没时间了！",
                "pinyin": "hái hē chá ne ， méi shíjiān le ！",
                "meaning": "Tea? There is no time for that!",
                "audio": "c198d85bae380949876939d116ec393d237a852952b7f911f950a8e76c5562e3"
              },
              {
                "text": "还看书呢，该走了！",
                "pinyin": "hái kàn shū ne ， gāi zǒu le ！",
                "meaning": "Reading now? It is time to leave!",
                "audio": "90473b9d1b832c4ce7bc30e2eb7984400ac25f9defb2aa414db59f51caad421d"
              }
            ]
          },
